Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Aurichalcos is powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it does have limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It can only capture a\Nsoul when a duelist loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and therein lies the secret\Nto escaping its wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope Joey does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds are not in my\Nfavor, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it ain't over till it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I gotta keep those Harpy's\Nclaws off of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I gotta destroy that magic circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a card in\Nmy deck that can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could wipe the seal\Nof Orycalcos off the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it wouldn't be able\Nto take anyone's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This card might do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I got to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the fiend Mega Cyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But that has six stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to its special ability, I can\Nsummon it without making a sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you have more\Nmonsters in play than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.83,0:02:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my friend, attack\Na harpy with Cyberswipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey's back in the game, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if Joey wins the\Nduel, then we lose Mai forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Joey's trying to win. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he has discovered the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What secret are we talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret to ending this duel\Nwithout either of them losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Wheeler decided to\Ngo down fighting after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that\Nscrawny punk's gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At least there'd be a little\Nexcitement for a change
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this face down. Your move,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,mate I was worried about\Nyou for a second there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler I thought you'd lost your touch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me this means\Nyou've accepted the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that we're not friends\NBecause for the last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the part of me that was dumb\Nenough to like you is long gone now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life's never gonna be the same again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,my everything you ever\Nwanted in your whole
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:04:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,life is right here and\Nwhere exactly is right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,here i can handle things from now on valon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,who are you please call me darts\Ni've been expecting you for some time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecting me? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see that this\Nis where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come home, to a place\Nwhere everyone understands you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No longer will the cruelty of the\Noutside world feed your loneliness, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know so much about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all in your eyes, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, destroy her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, my?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to enter a world\Nof darkness for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.35,0:05:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a tournament to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I don't want to go back to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,place i don't want to lose again of course
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,not and i'll make sure you never do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been lied to for too long those who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,called themselves your friends all turned\Non you you poor thing those scoundrels
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,left you all alone in that terrible\Nplace while they soaked up all the glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve so much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to be the greatest\Nduelist the world's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, and the ultimate\Npower shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's one thing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you surrender your\Nweak side? Of course! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The power you desire is now yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,from this day forth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll serve the ory calcos\Nyour time's up I win as soon as
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack your life points are gone\Nand of course so is your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. Note
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to self seatbelts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,were invented for a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that's weird why would\Nindustrial illusions be closed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, it's Duke. Hey,\Nyou're right. Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,how'd you know we were\Nhere It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys dueling in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but why it's a\Nlonger story. So listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't have time to\Nstand here chit-chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help now. We're\Nall trapped in this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and you gotta find a way to get us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a regular party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it's that magic circle yeah\Nthe same one we were trapped in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,i sacrifice my two harpies that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,allows me to summon harpy's pet dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and thanks to the seal of orichalcos\Nit gets 500 more points plus
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it gets another 300 points for\Nevery harpy i have on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it has 3,400 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been nice knowing you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my Harpy's pet dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his feed, Megasimer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal Compensation Mediation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this trap card gets shuffled\Nwith two cards from your graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have to draw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If I choose my own card,\Nyour attack gets blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have a one in three chance\Nof making it past this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if Joey picks\None of my two cards, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he loses the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way that\NPipsqueak's gonna get himself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,out of this mess by\Nplaying a game of chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never pick the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, time to pick two cards\Nfrom your graveyard. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now let's shuffle\Nall three of them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound pretty confident for\Nsomeone who's about to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time, you're still\Nrelying on luck to win your duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It took skill to play the\Nright card at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But a little luck never hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna choose the middle card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let that be the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he could do it! You go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, next time I play\Nbingo, I'm bringing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there goes your theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your last attack didn't\Nwork, so I'm still in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Joey bought\Nhimself a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it did come with\Na price, Taya. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But your little maneuver\Nhelped me out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you get to put the two cards\Nyou picked at the top of your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she can use those two cards again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady Phoenix Formation\Nand Harpy Sparrow Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are two of my most powerful cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have stopped my\Nattack, but my turn's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll move one of my\NHarpy Ladies to rear defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll place two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one more shot to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm all out of ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over\Nyet, and it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon a monster face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Last but not least, I'll switch\Nmy fiend to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's locked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you seem pretty calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone about to\Nlose their soul, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I've been involved in\Nsome pretty insane duels in my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and I learned a real important\Nlesson about this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting till the last point is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And last I checked, I still had\Na handful of life points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So drop your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, because I\Nhave a face-down card too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap jammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It cancels out your trap card, so if you\Ndon't mind, I'd like to continue my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm always one step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be a fun way to\Nend things, but not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The top card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's either Phoenix or Sparrow Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Harpy's Pet Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his fiend now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his faced-out monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:13:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,who's the man you just destroyed\Nmy fiber jaw and more importantly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,activated its special ability so we\Nhave to dump all our cards in one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,big pile and then we each pick\Nfive i know how the card works not
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,like it really matters now my trap\Ncancels it out what what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of my harpy's\Nfeather storm is able
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,to deactivate your\Nmonster's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it looks like Joey's\Nfresh out of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,again teia hang in there\Nyour life points are
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,exposed but lucky for\Nyou i have to end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see what kind of desperate\Nmove you've got now. Desperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one monster face\Ndown and that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you you were desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:14:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Mar to\Ndeliver the finishing touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss seeing Wheeler\NSquirm, but I'll move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one monster left to crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna send this\Npoor sap out with a bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I activate my Harpy\NLady Phoenix Formation card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,his puny face-down monsters are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.69,0:14:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to its secondary power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be wiping out what's\Nleft of his life points, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Harpy\NLady Phoenix Formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And in case you're too stunned to figure\Nthis out, it means I win the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Desistence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my buddy, Nekomane King.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He has zero attack points, so\NI didn't lose any life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you just wasted\Nyour best card. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.85,0:15:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nekomane King has a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you destroyed it using a magic card,\Nyour turn automatically comes to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,which puts me in the driver's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close. I don't\Nknow how much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of this I can take The\Nguy's got more lives
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,than my cat He just\Nkeeps stalling for more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,time But how much longer\Ncan he keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your strategy to drag this out\Nforever so I forfeit from boredom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just worry about your own\Nstrategy and let me worry about mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,mine's got a point I'm just\Nputting things off for as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I can until I figure\Na way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And quitting's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what those\Nbiker creeps want me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta save mine and find out what\Nthe brute squad up there is really after.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's gonna take some kind of miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's something in\Nmy deck that can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye of Timaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My dual disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Fang of Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, wasn't I just\Nin the middle of a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been to this place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Dominion of the Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one big ice sculpture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dragon, frozen\Nin time. Huh? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling it's chosen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If my theory's correct, then you\Nmust remove that sword. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the ancient dragon will awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn that I heard someone\Ntalking to me through that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You must release Hermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked. Now I\Ngot one more question, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this thing friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey's got one of those\Ndragons in his deck, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be just what
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.39,0:18:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice anything strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides the way you're acting? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reacting to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh must be behind this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a duel to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw something\Ngood now, I'm as good as gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that dragon, Hermos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he draw something good or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is his last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have just drawn\Nthe dragon he released.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Its power is now his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermos, you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to meet\Nmy new friend, Hermos!
